{
    "title": "LUDUS - Merge Battle Arena PvP",
    "description": "Welcome to the strategy game LUDUS \u2013 Merge Battle Arena PvP! Let's fight in real time strategy PvP multiplayer battles games! Build card deck, upgrade summoners, defend your army on the battleground, merge battle units, and duel other players. Level up your skills in the merge arena, use strategy, claim victory, and take the top spot among other players! LUDUS has unique strategy and tactic gameplay, battling and merging mechanics set in a realm of clans, magic and fantasy. Build a deck of guard heroes, make it a tower of your strength and rush to defend your squad and troops in a merge war! Win royale battles and beat armies from around the planet: master tactics games and be the strongest PvP auto battle player!\r\n\r\nENTER THE WORLD OF MERGE STRATEGY GAMES \r\nCollect and level up your heroes to unlock even more arenas and empires for further epic clash battles! Devise ingenious fighting tactics and card battle strategies to defeat PvP opponents, collect even more legion heroes, and become the greatest Merge Arena champion of them all!\r\n\r\nWORK YOUR WAY UP TO SUCCESS AND VICTORY\r\nBuild your deck of cards, conquer the game board, and fight your way through an intense duel on arenas! Master the merge and conquest strategy. Create a balanced deck, level up your card heroes and army of warriors, learn to match, summon and use abilities and spells, and play smart to survive!\r\n\r\nUNLOCK ADVANCED HEROES\r\nEach hero is a star of legends. Each has unique abilities: they can summon a mass of minions, destroy defences, become guardians of the kingdom or an archer and shoot their monster enemies! Gather a fight squad and go into combat! Don't be idle auto battler: brawl, win, climb the leaderboard, and move to new arenas by matching and collecting. Unlock the league system and become the legend of card wars!\r\n\r\nQUESTS, BATTLE PASS, AND ADVENTURES\r\nExplore various game modes, tournaments, races, and leaderboards to challenge your tactical skills. Master and complete legendary quests, climb the battle pass levels, storm, and smite! Awesome rewards await so rush to your troops and clans. Become the card strategy champion of the board, cover yourself in glory, and unlock chests with rewards. Shoot for the stars with \u201cLudus: Merge Arena\u201d! Prepare for a real-time PvE combat in future updates - get ready to play against rivals.\r\n\r\nOUR EPIC STRATEGY AND TACTICS GAME FEATURES:\r\n\u00b7       Summon battling heroes, boost them by merging, and marvel at how fast your soldiers smash the enemy into smithereens in a real-time auto battle.\r\n\u00b7       Engage in PvP battles to rise to the top of deck building games and open up new arenas!\r\n\u00b7       Earn gold and rating points to level up your heroes and advance through the arenas system.\r\n\u00b7       Merge heroes and evolve your warriors to unlock new perks, abilities, and attacks or increase their stats for ultimate one-shot kills!\r\n\r\nJoin the strategy adventure game LUDUS: Merge Arena Battle PvP! Summon and merge heroes, unlock legendary abilities, and crush monsters and players in epic tactics PvP battles. Rise through arenas, and become the ultimate card battle strategy champion!",
