e your tactical skills. Master and complete legendary quests, climb the battle pass levels, storm, and smite! Awesome rewards await so rush to your troops and clans. Become the card strategy champion of the board, cover yourself in glory, and unlock chests with rewards. Shoot for the stars with \u201cLudus: Merge Arena\u201d! Prepare for a real-time PvE combat in future updates - get ready to play against rivals.<br><br>OUR EPIC STRATEGY AND TACTICS GAME FEATURES:<br>\u00b7       Summon battling heroes, boost them by merging, and marvel at how fast your soldiers smash the enemy into smithereens in a real-time auto battle.<br>\u00b7       Engage in PvP battles to rise to the top of deck building games and open up new arenas!<br>\u00b7       Earn gold and rating points to level up your heroes and advance through the arenas system.<br>\u00b7       Merge heroes and evolve your warriors to unlock new perks, abilities, and attacks or increase their stats for ultimate one-shot kills!<br><br>Join the strategy adventure game LUDUS: Merge Arena Battle PvP! Summon and merge heroes, unlock legendary abilities, and crush monsters and players in epic tactics PvP battles. Rise through arenas, and become the ultimate card battle strategy champion!",
